          <mxGeometry x="215" y="45" width="330" height="86" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="rec_reid" value="Adaptive ReID 상태 판별 (MODE_ADAPTIVE)&#xa;compute_dual_similarity_detail(): max(Anchor, Recent)&#xa;• COEX: 비중첩 원거리 타 ID 제외 / SAFE: len&gt;=2 불일치 4f 이탈&#xa;• GUARD: exclude_boxes + 0.60*외형+0.40*공간 (+0.04 관성)&#xa;• SEARCH: eligible + margin&gt;=0.06 + 2f 확정 / 1인&gt;=0.72 시 EMA" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="rec_box">
